
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Afterhours AI</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: #090711;
  color: #fff;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}
header {
  padding: 25px 18px;
  text-align: center;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #30233f;
}
.logo {
  color: #c49aff;
  font-size: 27px;
  font-weight: bold;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}
.hero {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 55px 20px 35px;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-size: 36px;
  line-height: 1.15;
}
.hero p { color: #b9afc8; line-height: 1.6; }
button {
  background: #9a62d6;
  border: 0;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  border-radius: 25px;
  color: white;
  font-weight: bold;
}
h2 { padding: 0 20px; }
.characters {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 15px 20px 40px;
}
.character {
  background: #171222;
  border: 1px solid #39264e;
  border-radius: 17px;
  padding: 22px;
}
.character h3 { color: #d4aaff; }
.character p { color: #b9afc8; line-height: 1.5; }
.tag {
  color: #c49aff;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}
footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  color: #8e849d;
  font-size: 12px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">AFTERHOURS AI</div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <p class="tag">YOUR WORLD. YOUR STORIES.</p>
  <h1>A universe of stories awaits.</h1>
  <p>Meet fictional AI personalities, explore imaginative stories and enjoy conversations in your own creative space.</p>
  <button onclick="document.getElementById('characters').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">
    Explore Characters
  </button>
</section>

<h2>Meet Your Characters</h2>

<section class="characters" id="characters">

  <div class="character">
    <p class="tag">THE MYSTERIOUS WRITER</p>
    <h3>Adrian</h3>
    <p>A thoughtful novelist with a love for literature, mysteries and meaningful conversations.</p>
    <button onclick="chat('Adrian')">Meet Adrian</button>
  </div>

  <div class="character">
    <p class="tag">THE CREATIVE DREAMER</p>
    <h3>Maya</h3>
    <p>An imaginative artist who loves music, adventure and creating unforgettable stories.</p>
    <button onclick="chat('Maya')">Meet Maya</button>
  </div>

  <div class="character">
    <p class="tag">THE CURIOUS EXPLORER</p>
    <h3>Leo</h3>
    <p>A curious traveller who enjoys discovering new places, ideas and adventures.</p>
    <button onclick="chat('Leo')">Meet Leo</button>
  </div>

</section>

<footer>
  AFTERHOURS AI © 2026<br>
  A creative world of fictional conversations.
</footer>

<script>
function chat(name) {
  alert("Welcome! " + name + "'s story experience is coming soon.");
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
